title: Example - Fountain test - generic transitions
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=Fountain

Test (Batch 1c): any uppercase line ending with `TO:` (preceded and followed by blank line) should render as a transition. Specific markers like `CUT TO:` continue to fire via the marker engine; the generic rule only catches the rest.

Jane drops the key on the table.

JUMP TO:

INT. ROOFTOP NIGHT

Wind tears at the laundry line.

ROLL TO:

INT. EDITING BAY NIGHT

The monitor flickers.

CUT TO:

A street at dawn. (CUT TO: still fires via its specific marker.)
